---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const tarih = 'October 12, 2026';
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy" description="Vumibo privacy policy: this website does not use cookies, analytics or trackers and does not collect personal information.">
  <section class="phero"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow" style="justify-self:center">Legal</p><h1>Privacy Policy</h1><p class="lead">Last updated: {tarih}</p></div></section>
  <section class="sec" style="padding-top:40px">
    <div class="prose">
      <p>Vumibo makes songs and cartoons for young children. We take children’s privacy seriously and keep this website as simple and safe as possible.</p>
      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>Nothing. This website does not use cookies, analytics, advertising or tracking tools, and it has no forms or accounts. We do not collect, store or share any personal information from children or adults.</p>
      <h2>Videos</h2>
      <p>Videos on this site are embedded from YouTube using its <strong>privacy-enhanced mode</strong> (youtube-nocookie.com). No video content is loaded from YouTube until you press play. When you play a video, YouTube’s own privacy policy applies. Our videos are marked “Made for Kids” on YouTube.</p>
      <h2>Links to other services</h2>
      <p>Links to YouTube, Spotify, Apple Music, Instagram and TikTok open those services in a new tab. Their privacy policies apply once you leave this site. Children should visit them with a parent.</p>
      <h2>Hosting</h2>
      <p>This site is hosted by Vercel. Like any web host, Vercel may process technical data such as IP addresses to deliver pages securely; we do not use this data to identify visitors.</p>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about this policy? Contact us through our YouTube channel’s “About” page.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
